# One-time Premium purchases

Every Premium purchase is a one-time month or a one-time year that adds a grant. Grants stack.
There is no purchase-kind discriminator.

A new processor implements `PaymentProcessorAdapter` and emits `payment_settled` and
`refund_or_revoke` only. A product that is not mapped in `billing_processor_product` produces
no events.
